+# S5-CLM-00003543 — quadratic p-adic Littlewood theorem
+
+This package binds the frozen Formal Conjectures declaration
+`Bugeaud08.problem_10_8.variants.quadratic` and its Stage 6 alias. The mathematical statement says that
+for a real number of algebraic degree two and a prime `p`, the infimum of
+`q * |q|_p * ||qξ||` over positive natural `q` is zero.
+
+Status: provisional `complete_candidate` (M0-W/R0), pending canonical-Master
+recomputation and acceptance. The readable DAG is total and injective; the worker
+does not set `master_accepted` and cannot advance the authoritative checklist.
